{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20951","headline":"贾公闾贵壻曲 · 李贺","name":"贾公闾贵壻曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝衣不须长，分花对袍缝。\n嘤嘤白马来，满脑黄金重。\n今朝香气苦，珊瑚涩难枕。\n且要弄风人，暖蒲沙上饮。\n燕语踏帘钩，日虹屏中碧。\n潘令在河阳，无人死芳色。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20951.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20951","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}